e` in integration tests.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 18 out of 18 changed files in this pull request and generated 5 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tool/internal/rule/base.go | Adds `IsTest *bool` to `FilterDef` with schema docs for tri-state behavior. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/filter.go | Implements `IsTestFilter` and wires `is_test` into `buildFile()` predicate selection and validation. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/filter_test.go | Adds unit tests for `IsTestFilter`, `Build()` coverage, and YAML round-trip expectations (`should_match`). |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/match_test.go | Adds end-to-end `preciseMatching` tests validating `.test` vs non-`.test` import paths. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/testdata/where/ok_is_test_true.yml | YAML fixture for `is_test: true`. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/testdata/where/ok_is_test_true.expected | Expected built filter shape for `is_test: true`. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/testdata/where/ok_is_test_false.yml | YAML fixture for `is_test: false`. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/testdata/where/ok_is_test_false.expected | Expected built filter shape for `is_test: false`. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/testdata/where/err_is_test_with_has_func.yml | Negative YAML fixture ensuring exclusivity guard triggers when combining predicates. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/instrument_test.go | Updates golden test harness to pre-filter rules using a `where.file` mirror (now including `is_test`). |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/is-test-filter-match/source.go | New golden fixture source for the match case. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/is-test-filter-match/rules.yml | New golden fixture rules using `is_test: false` (production-only). |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/is-test-filter-match/is_test_filter_match.otelc.globals.go.golden | New golden globals output for match case. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/is-test-filter-match/is_test_filter_match.main.go.golden | New golden instrumented output for match case. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/is-test-filter-match/hook.go | Hook implementations used by the match-case golden fixture. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/is-test-filter-no-match/source.go | New golden fixture source for the no-match case. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/is-test-filter-no-match/rules.yml | New golden fixture rules using `is_test: true` (test-only). |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/is-test-filter-no-match/is_test_filter_no_match.main.go.golden | New golden output for no-match case (expected to remain byte-identical). |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/562#pullrequestreview-4421295615","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/562","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/562#pullrequestreview-4421295615"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/562"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-03T17:54:43Z","commit_id":"2f19ebad316334cdb36c505ae68d44da88e4473f"},{"id":4570107641,"node_id":"PRR_kwDONpzSS88AAAABEGZO-Q","user":{"login":"copilot-pull